### GET - listar alunos
GET http://localhost:8085/alunos

### POST - cadastrar aluno
POST http://localhost:8085/alunos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "idade": 20
}

### PUT - alterar o aluno com id 1
PUT http://localhost:8085/alunos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Maria",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "idade": 21
}

### DELETE - apagar o aluno com id 1
DELETE http://localhost:8085/alunos/1
